Important notes

Rounded corners are handled by picom (corner-radius = 12).
Volume & brightness keys are bound in the i3 config and also appear on polybar.
Vencord is provided via vesktop (most reliable method in 2026).
Limine is installed as a package; you may still need a one-time manual deployment depending on how you installed the base system (see ArchWiki Limine page).

After first login, run set-wallpaper /path/to/image.jpg to apply a wallpaper + pywal colors.

